の挿絵等、SNSや個人サイト等でのキャラクター紹介・個人活動の告知等、コミッションでのリクエストのための参考資料等)を考えています。\nもしご都合が合えばよろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15QcfblJ6ABjLUrKZ3ijKi-ncxD6c6GKd", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": []}, "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 8000, "recorded_at": 1779883318.486444}, {"amount": 7000, "recorded_at": 1780441122.482946}, {"amount": 18000, "recorded_at": 1781875248.472566}], "correction": [{"amount": 4000, "recorded_at": 1779883318.486444}, {"amount": 5000, "recorded_at": 1781266828.87494}, {"amount": 3000, "recorded_at": 1781875248.472566}]}, "custom": {}}